{"success": true, "name": "arc-stream-demo-discipline", "file": "references/task-36d8805c-review.md", "content": "# Review: heterogeneous demos and speculative submissions

In this Continual-ARC instance, eight demonstrations varied dramatically in dimensions (from 10x6 to 29x30), palette, background, edge-bar placement, sparse marker locations, and output deltas. Some demos extended a line from a marker, others filled regions, and others changed differently shaped areas. The test was a 14x11 grid with a 3-cell color-2 bar at the top and bottom, plus three isolated color-3 cells.

